window.products.push({"id":952018,"name":"National Arcraft Snow Globe with Maple Finish Base is A Fun Project for Do-It-Yourselfers (Pkg/2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31sGS1yiBwL._AC_.jpg","description":"This clear glass water/snow globe is fun and easy to assemble. Just create a design of your own out of any water resistant material (polymer clay is especially suitable), then glue it to the rubber gasket provided. Fill the globe with water, add the floating bits that are included, then add one drop of a low-sudsing detergent to break the surface tension of the water. Work the rubber gasket into the neck of the globe and seal around the edge with silicone sealer. Apply the base and you are finished. This globe makes a great personalized gift. The globe measures 3-1/8 inches in diameter and 4 inches high overall when placed in its maple finish base. The neck opening has an inside diameter of 1-3/4 inches. Distance from top of gasket to inside top of globe is 2-5/8\". Included in this offer are two complete water globe kits, each consisting of a glass globe, maple finish base, rubber gasket, floating bits and printed instructions. For hundreds more craft, art and hobby products be sure to visit our National Artcraft Storefront. We have the creative component you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31sGS1yiBwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Arcraft","source_asin":"B001ECL6WE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952018","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001ECL6WE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001ECL6WE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
