window.products.push({"id":952268,"name":"NOTCHIS 32 Ounce/2 Pound Value Pack of Turquoise Water Gel Beads, 80,000 Vase Fillers Floral Beads Water Grow Gel Bead, Make 32 Gallons or 120 Liter o","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71treDV7IYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Safe and reliable, water gel beads uses the same polymer that is in babies’ diapers. In the water, they will magically grow into marble-sized water pearls. These charming water vase beads are popular for use in wedding centerpieces and as vase fillers. Paired with the submersible LED Tealight, the floral beads will take on a beautiful glow. Perfect for any party or festive event, bridal/baby showers, weddings, anniversaries. Important Questions and Answers. Q: 32oz beads can be used to make how many liters or gallons of water pearls? A: 32 gallons or 120L of water pearls. The floral beads require soaking in water for 6 hours. Gel water pearls will grow up to 18-20mm after absorbing enough water. Q: 32 gallons or 120L of blue water pearls means that it can fill how many vases? A: Different heights correspond to vases of different quantities. 4\" x 6\": 96 vases 4\" x 7.5\" : 80 vases 4\" x 10.5\": 56 vases 6\" x 10.5\": 24 vases If you only fill it to 3/4 of its height, you actually can fill even more vases. Q: How to hydrate the Water Gels? A: The beads require soaking in water for 6 hours. 32oz of water: 1.5 tsp beads 64oz of water: 3 tsp beads 1 L of water: 1.5 tsp beads 1 quart of water: 1.5 tsp beads 1 gallon of water: 5 tsp beads After absorbing enough water, water pearls will magically grow into turquoise marble-sized water pearls. Services: We save you time when preparing activities by exclusively providing services for calculating vase volume and water gel bead usage. We can answer your questions within 12 hours. Please use Customer Questions to ask a question. You only need to provide the vase’s diameter, height, and quantity. Specifications: Color: turquoise Weight: approx. 32 oz/2 pound Bead Size: 2.5-3 mm in diameter. Please Note: Vase is not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71treDV7IYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOTCHIS","source_asin":"B0BM8452V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952268","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM8452V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM8452V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
