window.products.push({"id":952280,"name":"Chicology Deluxe Free-Stop Cordless Roller Shades, No Tug Privacy Window Blind, Felton Truffle (Privacy & Natural Woven), 23\"W X 72\"H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDVE3WmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish and functional, this shade will bring out the best in a room, while blocking out light. A top-of-the-line roller shade, designed for the resourceful homeowner. It includes an aluminium cassette valance, a cordless mechanism that is unmatched, in beautiful natural-woven, durable fabrics. This combination will enhance your overall décor and be a perfect complement to your new home update. The fabrics will filter the light beautifully during the day while providing privacy at night. The aluminium hardcover valance is sleek and durable. It includes a matching fabric cover for a complete and premium look. The cordless mechanism is called Free-Stop. Unlike your typical rollers this one is smooth and easy to operate; no hassles or constant tugging. It works as you’d expect. Many of our customers who try it tell us this is simply the best mechanism they’ve used. Being cordless, this shade is safe for both children and pets. It is ideal for kitchens, bedrooms, offices, living rooms, family rooms, nurseries, children’s rooms, bathrooms, and more. The Cordless Roller Shade is capable of inside or outside mount. For inside mount, please note there is a standard half-inch deduction on the width to ensure a snug fit. A minimum of 2-inches depth is required for inside mount. The valance depth is 3-inches. The gap between the valance and the fabric is an inch on both sides. Installation is very easy. Simply install the brackets either on the ceiling or the wall, push to clip the head rail onto the brackets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bDVE3WmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOLOGY","source_asin":"B01KP41IJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952280","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KP41IJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KP41IJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
