window.products.push({"id":952348,"name":"istanbulx Set of 6 - New Season Brightest Diamond Weave Turkish Cotton Bath Beach Hammam Towel Peshtemal Blanket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p-xuG1utL._AC_SL1209_.jpg","description":"A Breakthrough You Can Feel Finally, a beach towel that moisturizes your skin every time you dry off! By infusing a layer of natural Aloe Vera gel extract with our deluxe towel, now a day under the sun is even more enjoyable as the silky smooth fabric keeps your skin hydrated and cool.Bring Home Memories, Not Sand Don’t let pesky debris get in the way of you having fun at the beach. Our sand-free towels are a breeze to keep clean. All it takes is a good shake or two (away from others close by, of course), and they are good to go. At long last, no more gritty car seats or clogged washers.The Ultimate Beach Blanket Looking for a towel that’s plenty large yet still lightweight and easy to carry? We’ve got you covered literally from head to toe. Measuring at an extra-large 38 by 70 inches while weighing less than 10 oz, you can easily fold it down to fit any compact space for effortless packing.Savor Life to the Fullest At Vivence, we are committed to bringing you innovative products that are smartly designed and a pleasure to use. Our unique Turkish beach towel combines premium quality with the soothing benefits of Aloe Vera. Find out for yourself why it’s the ideal companion for your next trip to the outdoors.Ready Whenever You Are Can’t wait to get out and get some rays? No problem. This beach towel comes pre-washed for that extra fluffiness right out of the package. It also limits shrinkage when you follow the simple care instructions and gets even softer and more comfortable over time!Be Pampered Anywhere Just think of all the places a nice big towel could come in handy: in the bathroom, at a picnic, yoga studio, spa, or gym, on a camping or backpacking trip; the possibilities are endless. No matter where you are going, count on our cozy Turkish towel to keep you in comfort!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p-xuG1utL._AC_SL1209_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"istanbulx","source_asin":"B079C2G7WS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079C2G7WS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079C2G7WS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
