window.products.push({"id":952407,"name":"Teekland 10'x20' Outdoor Gazebo Canopy,Heavy Duty Party Tent,Pop-up Canopy Tent,Instant Canopy Tent,Practical Waterproof Folding Tent with Carry Bag B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k3YnOmDgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Introductions: Tent is a practical item for daily use, widely seen in the outdoor activities such as camping or picnic. If you happen to need a tent for own use, this 3 x 6m Two Windows Practical Waterproof Folding Tent may be a great choice. It is designed into 4 sides, with 2 windows that ensure good ventilation. Made of premium 210D oxford material and steel materials, it is of great durability and solid structure. Waterproof fabric makes it suitable for outdoor use. It is easy to install and use. Most of all, it is quite space-saving when it folds. A convenient and stylish item! Features: 1. New and in a good condition 2. First-rate steel and 210D oxford materials, fine workmanship and meticulous treatment 3. Excellent ventilation with 2 windows 4. Won't take up too much space when it is folded 5. It is a sort of waterproof item, fit for outdoor use especially 6. Protect you from scorching sun light and rain 7. Button design, convenient to assemble and disassemble 8. Every side has a hole to tie the nail firmly and make the tent more stable Specifications: 1. Material: 210D Silver Oxford Fabric & Steel  2. Color: Blue 3. Dimensions: (118 x 236)\" / (300 x 600)cm (L x W) 4. Weight: 49.16 lbs / 22.3 kg 5. Waterproof: Yes 6. Suitable for: All Kinds Of Events 7. Height of Roof: 100.39\" / 255cm 8. Door Quantity: 2 Pcs 9. Window Quantity: 2 Pcs 10. With Periphery Cloth: Yes Package Includes: 1 x Tent 1 x Carry Bag 1 x Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k3YnOmDgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Teekland","source_asin":"B07PFK4VSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PFK4VSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PFK4VSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":952408,"name":"SEDSED Star W Man-Dalorian The Child Baby YODA Home Decoration Large Rug Floor Carpet Yoga Mat,Indoor/Outdoor Large Area Rugs Decor Mat 36\"x24\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nv8dhRbVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to order our high quality floor mats 1. Easy to care for and durable makes this Environmental Bedroom Home Carpet a true value. 2.This Skidproof Carpet features with soft touch feeling and easy to clean and maintain. 3.Add a chic, fresh touch to your favorite room, tie together new and old pieces and breathe new life into your home with this skid proof Carpet Embellish a transitional-style living room floor with this skid proof Carpet. 4.These floor carpets will protect all carpet flooring from damage and enable you to easily and smoothly roll from task to task in your workspace or home. Size 36\"(L) X 24\"(W)-91X60cm Package Include 1X Carpet Note Upon opening the rug from its shipping wrapper, reverse roll the rug so that the pile of the rug is facing out to the touch. Should there be a crease in the rug, put pressure at the point of the visible crease, loosening the crease allowing the rug to flatten out. When placing the rug on the floor should the corners or ends want to turn up, simply place a heavy book or other heavy objects on the turned-up area for a few hours, or in extreme cases leave the heavy object on the turned-up area over-night. In order to get maximum use out of your new rug, regular vacuuming is highly recommended. The use of a non-slip rug pad along with the periodic rotation of the rug within the room setting will minimize uneven wear and traffic patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Nv8dhRbVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEDSED","source_asin":"B08K996J6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K996J6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K996J6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":952409,"name":"Hredxin Digital Alarm Clock, Recording Alarm Clocks, Digital Clock, Clock for Bedroom, Desk Clock with USB Port, Kids Alarm Clock with 2 Alarm, Digita","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515RtiuZK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【Recording alarm clock】 You can record an audio clip (up to 30 seconds) and use it as an alarm ringtone. This audio clip can be from your lover, mom, dad, friend et al. Imagine how wonderful it is for your lover to wake you up every day. ⏰【Snooze Mode】If you really need some extra sleep you can easily find and shake it to temporarily turn off the alarm for 5 minutes, and the alarm will ring again after 5 minutes . You can keep shaking to cycle snooze mode or press any other key to cancel the snooze function. The trigger of the snooze mode is designed to shake the alarm clock, which is easy to operate, even you can operate without opening your eyes. Very suitable for heavy sleepers. ⏰【Adjustable Brightness & Night Mode】The digital alarm clock provides 3-level brightness. You are able to adjust to a comfortable brightness manually. Besides, the LED light will automatically dim during your sleep time (22 o'clock to 6 o'clock) to protect your eyes at night and save energy. No blinding lights or any annoying sounds disturb your sleep, create an peaceful environment for sleep. ⏰【Intelligent Voice Control】This alarm clock has a built-in sound sensor. When sound reaching 90 decibels or gently taps on the table( or tap the clock) where the clock is placed the screen will wake-up, and the screen will go off automatically after 20 seconds. After plugging in the USB charging cable, the screen will always keep the brightness; while pulling out it, the digital alarm clock will automatically enter the voice-activated energy-saving mode. ⏰【Large LED Mirror Display】 Digital clock is equipped with a large size LED display, you can clearly check the time anywhere in the room. Digital clock has 3 different brightness levels of lights, so you can choose any brightness to protect your eyesight according to your sleep needs. With unique mirror technology, alarm clocks can also be used as a dressing mirror.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515RtiuZK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hredxin","source_asin":"B097JR2DYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JR2DYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JR2DYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":952410,"name":"Beautiful White Magnolia Doily, Floral Design and Green Leaves Embroidered Cutwork Edges on Brown Polyester Linen (15 Inch Round)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eN4kZ4-dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful floral Magnolia design table linens on brown polyester linen featuring exquisite embroidery and eye-catching cutwork to dress up any table. Perfect for holidays, special occasions, and every day especially during the Spring and Summer season. 100% polyester. Super easy care: wash in cool water with similar colors, tumble dry low, remove promptly, or hang to air dry. Cool iron if needed. Or spot clean with a damp cloth/wipe. Very durable and will last for many years and can be a wonderful addition to your dining or kitchen table with a beautiful centerpiece or on a coffee or end table as accents. Also, dress up your bedroom with the runners on your dressers or night stands.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91eN4kZ4-dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linens, Art and Things","source_asin":"B084RP25H9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084RP25H9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084RP25H9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
