window.products.push({"id":952579,"name":"Professional 8\" Kitchen Chef Knife, Beautiful and Durable Finished Wood Handle, High Carbon Stainless Steel Blade Stays Sharp, Weighted and Balanced f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Je0ul+lgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STAINLESS STEEL BLADE: This Professional 8'' chef's knife by Our Simple Luxuries is made of German Quality 416 High Carbon Stainless Steel -- the professionals chef's blade of choice. German 416 high carbon stainless perfectly balances hardness and stain resistance to keep your knife blade sharp and to prevent rust and will not fade or tarnish with years of use. BEAUTIFUL & DURABLE HANDLE: The natural wood grain handle is moisture-resistant, ergonomically designed, and is weighted for a comfortable grip that gives you maximal cutting power and control even if the handle is wet. This makes food preparation safer and more efficient. The exquisitely design includes mosaic riveting, and gold ring detail. PRECISION SHARPNESS FOR SAFE & EASY CHOPPING AND CUTTING: The knife is professional grade and will satisfy the most demanding needs and is equally valuable for any home chef. The knife blade is one solid piece from the tip of the blade entirely through the handle which provides superior balance and control in the kitchen and is engineered to provide world class precision chopping, slicing, dicing, and mincing. MAXIMUM DURABILITY: Resists stain and wear to protect your investment for many years to come. Because of the high carbon stainless blade and natural wood handle, it is dishwasher safe and heat resistant. The handle is made of beautiful and durable Pakkawood which has the same look and feel as wood but will not warp or split and is largely water proof while maintaining an attractive polish. PERFECT FOR GIFT GIVING OR FOR YOUR OWN KITCHEN: This beautiful professional chef's knife comes with an elegant and functional giftbox that is foam padded and has a magnetic clasp. This gift boxed knife is a joy to receive and open and will be cherished for years to come making it perfect for any gift giving occasion such as a wedding, birthday, or holiday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Je0ul+lgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Our Simple Luxuries","source_asin":"B074YWTHVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074YWTHVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074YWTHVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
