window.products.push({"id":952673,"name":"Toothpaste Dispenser,Automatic Toothpaste Squeezer Fit for Kids and Adults,Hands Free Wall Mounted Toothpaste Holder With Self-stick Sticker,Punch-Fre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DLsrIaqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"◕‿◕Easy to Use The automatic toothpaste dispenser is non-contact operation, hygienic and convenient, frees hands, and can easily control the length of toothpaste extrusion according to the strength. Dual-position technology, the upper layer is suitable for kids with a small amount of extrusion, and the lower layer is suitable for adults with a larger amount of extrusion, and the amount of toothpaste is not wasted. ◕‿◕Easy to Install -Clean and dry the wall, Rip off the protective film of the adhesive. - Stick to the wall and vent the air, Install toothpaste into the Toothpaste Dispenser. - Place toothpaste, Squeeze toothpaste by manual to vent air. - Please use it after 24 hours of installation. -If your child is under 6 years old, Please accompany your child to use this product. ◕‿◕Installation Notes Applicable wall: smooth tile, wooden wall, smooth marble, smooth glass, frosted glass, smooth metal. Not applicable wall: wallpaper, lime wall, paint wall. Please clean and dry the wall before installing. If you want to remove the toothpaste dispenser from the wall, you need to use a blower to blow the back of the product until the solid glue on the back melts. This process may be a bit long, please be patient and remove it. ◕‿◕Washable and Reusable You can disassemble the structure of the product by yourself to clean it directly. It's easy to clean, you need to clean it every 5- 7 days. ◕‿◕Warms Tips Please squeeze the toothpaste body after installation toothpaste squeezer dispenser when you upon the first use of this product, and press the button several times to remove any air inside the toothpaste dispenser until toothpaste comes out of the nozzle. ◕‿◕Package Include: 1pc Toothpaste Dispenser","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DLsrIaqCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Visen","source_asin":"B08K4D159V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K4D159V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K4D159V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":952674,"name":"Calphalon Classic Hard-Anodized Deep Roaster with Rack and Bonus Lifters and Baster","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HR9C4Q1XL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Calphalon Classic Hard Anodized 16\"x13\"x3.85\" Deep Roaster w/Roasting Rack plus bonus set of 2 Stainless Steel Turkey Lifters, Stainless Baster and Injector Tip. Features hard anodized interior for the best searing and sauces, durable hard anodized interior and exterior, nonstick \"v\" roasting rack with convenient lifter handles, and it's the ideal size for turkey's 19to 25lbs. Amazon.com Accompanied by a bonus roasting rack, silicone bulb baster with an injector tip, and two 18/8 stainless-steel turkey lifters, this 16-by-13 inch roaster pan is ideal for cooking a massive turkey (19 to 25 pounds), two chickens, or a hefty prime rib. Made of heavy-gauge anodized aluminum, the pan is harder than steel and conducts heat evenly whether it's baking lasagna or caramelizing a roast's pan juices. The pan's riveted, cast-stainless-steel handles stand straight up for easy handling and are large enough to accommodate oven mitts. The rack has its own set of large handles and is coated with nonstick so it won't pull off pieces of a bird's browned skin. The bulb baster's injector tip can be used to squirt flavoring deep into a fowl or roast. The lifters each have four curved prongs for sliding under a turkey or roast so it can be easily removed from the rack and placed on a carving board or serving platter. Both pan and rack carry a lifetime warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HR9C4Q1XL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B000067FD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000067FD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000067FD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
