window.products.push({"id":952719,"name":"RIPTIDE BREWING PUMP by Blichmann Engineering (from March Pumps) With Integrated Valve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":226.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WkuaK+GOS._AC_.jpg","description":"The all new RipTide is the very first pump designed specifically for homebrewing!  Designed by Blichmann and Manufactured by March the RipTide is the last homebrew pump you'll ever need!  (Unless you want a pair!) In addition to being the quietest pump on the market at 50dB we've solved the problems that have plagued homebrewers for years!  Not only does it look cool this pump is quieter and stronger than any other in its class.  The additional 3-5' of lift pressure and infinite head angle alone make it worth the cost.  Compare the specs and you'll see why this pump is an extra 50-70.  Expect it to last years longer than comparable pumps.  FREE SHIPPING -AND- a FURTHER DISCOUNT in your cart. We've solved the problems that have plagued homebrewers for years!  Gone are the days of making do with a general purpose pump such as the March 815 and all the variant imported copies. These pumps are cumbersome to disassemble, difficult to prime to get the wort moving, require the addition of a valve, a switch, and a proper base to hold the pump upright. They also use noisy open motors that must be shielded from liquids. All undesireable attributes for a homebrewing pump!  The team of homebrewers at Blichmann Engineering and our friends at March Manufacturing have created the RipTide to solve all of these problems! Assembled in USA from USA and imported components","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31WkuaK+GOS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blichmann","source_asin":"B0992GWS28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0992GWS28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0992GWS28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
