window.products.push({"id":952755,"name":"Bread Lame Cutter, Bread Scoring Tool, Lame Bread Tool for Bread Cutter for Homemade Bread, | Bakers Lame| Bread Razor or Bread Scoring Knife, Bread S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ILtT3OR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5 STAR MOON BREAD LAME, OUR UFO BREAD LAME CUTTER USED FOR SCORING DOUGH BEFORE BAKING Everyone at 5 STAR MOON is passionate about the quality of materials used in our kitchenware range, eye catching elegant design and working with quality ingredients to produce amazing food. Feel in control with this easy to use, safe bread scorer blade our bread lame cutter allows you to slash the dough in a safe controlled manner. Artistic flair to create some amazing scoring on the dough resulting in a rustic artisan sourdough loaf that you will be proud of. What does slashing the dough really mean? Using you bread lame to slash the dough allows it to expand during baking. The purpose is primarily to control the direction in which the bread will expand during \" oven spring \" What happens if you don’t score your bread? When you subject your dough to the heat of the oven the air in it starts to expand, causing the bread to rise. If your dough is not scored using a bread lame cutter, then it will crack in the most unexpected places. Also scoring ensures that you won’t get large pockets of air in your bread. Scoring and slashing the bread significantly improves the appearance of the bread. MORE CONTROL 5 STAR MOON bread lame design allows you to hold the disk between your fingers and thumb this allows you to have greater control than when holding a traditional long handled bread lame. PACKAGE INCLUDES 1 X UFO Wooden Bread Lame 1 X Protective Suede Case 5 X Razor Sharp Blades 1 X 5 Star Moon Gift Box 5 STAR MOON have designed this bread lame cutter with lots of love and passion and we truly hope you enjoy using it and get lots of pleasure out of it creating some amazing rustic sourdough bread and baguettes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ILtT3OR2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 star moon","source_asin":"B08R7R7LZV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-952755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R7R7LZV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R7R7LZV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
